            {
               "text": "<p class=\"desc\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 600 180\" role=\"img\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMid meet\" style=\"width:100%; height:auto; max-width:600px; display:block; margin:0 auto;\" aria-label=\"A ball pushed to the right by a force of 10 newtons, shown as a long red arrow\"><line x1=\"30\" y1=\"140\" x2=\"570\" y2=\"140\" stroke=\"#95a5a6\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><circle cx=\"120\" cy=\"110\" r=\"30\" fill=\"#2f6fb3\"/><line x1=\"152\" y1=\"110\" x2=\"328\" y2=\"110\" stroke=\"#c0392b\" stroke-width=\"8\"/><polygon points=\"316,99 330,110 316,121\" fill=\"#c0392b\"/><text x=\"240\" y=\"86\" font-size=\"22\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#c0392b\" font-weight=\"bold\">10 N</text></svg></p><p class=\"desc\"><b>Chart 3</b>: A force of 10 newtons pushes the ball to the right. The arrow is the longest, so this is the biggest force of the three.</p>",
